WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.225
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.275 --> 00:00:05.900
Tiny Coders, video 5.

3
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.320
If this, then that.

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.988
Sometimes the next step depends on what is true right now.

5
00:00:14.038 --> 00:00:15.570
That is a condition.

6
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.449
If it is raining, then take an umbrella.

7
00:00:20.499 --> 00:00:23.200
If the light is red, then stop.

8
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:28.790
Robots do this too: if the sensor sees a line, then go forward.

9
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.722
Conditions keep programs flexible.

10
00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:37.350
One plan can take different paths depending on what is true.

11
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.149
Let us recap.

12
00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:43.807
Conditions choose which steps run.

13
00:00:43.857 --> 00:00:47.250
If…then keeps programs flexible.

14
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.370
Next: Bugs: find the mistake.
